      "id": "sol.ahsme-1969-p9.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The integers run from \\(2\\) through \\(2+51=53.\\) Their mean is the average of the first and last: \\[ \\frac{2+53}{2}=\\frac{55}{2}=27\\frac12. \\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is C.",
